OL,3,GNEWSAGreggs to shut four factories and
OL,4,Acut 740 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh street bakery brand Greggs has
OL,7,Fannounced plans to shut four of its
OL,8,Ffactories and cut 740 jobs.
OL,10,FIt plans to close manufacturing sites
OL,11,Fat North Lakes near Penrith, Cumbria,
OL,12,FPettigrews in Kelso, Scotland, Seaham
OL,13,Fin County Durham and Enfield, Greater
OL,14,FLondon, though distribution operations
OL,15,Fwould continue to run from the latter.
OL,17,FThe proposals will also impact
OL,18,Fmanufacturing operations at its
OL,19,FTreforest site in Wales, but this will
OL,20,Falso continue as a distribution centre
OL,21,Ffor the business.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
