OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGreggs to shut four factories and
OL,4,Acut 740 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chain, which has headquarters in
OL,7,FNewcastle, said its retail shops would
OL,8,Fnot be affected by the proposed changes
OL,9,Fand like-for-like sales had grown
OL,10,Facross its managed stores.
